// DevPilot AI — Pipeline RAG agentique  (Eraser diagram-as-code)
title Pipeline RAG agentique — 7 agents

colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
direction right

Question [icon: message-circle, color: blue]

Pipeline [icon: workflow, color: purple] {
  Router [icon: git-branch, label: "Router"]
  QueryRewriter [icon: edit, label: "Query Rewriter"]
  Retrieval [icon: search, label: "Retrieval"]
  Reranker [icon: bar-chart, label: "Reranker"]
  Generator [icon: sparkles, label: "Generator"]
  Evaluator [icon: shield, label: "Evaluator"]
  Corrector [icon: tool, label: "Corrector"]
}

Qdrant [icon: database, color: green, label: "Qdrant · k=15"]
Gemini [icon: google, color: teal, label: "Gemini 2.5 Flash"]
Answer [icon: check-circle, color: green, label: "Réponse ancrée + citée"]

Question > Router
Router > QueryRewriter
QueryRewriter > Retrieval
Retrieval > Qdrant: 15 candidats
Retrieval > Reranker
Reranker > Generator: top 5
Generator > Gemini: stream
Generator > Evaluator
Evaluator > Corrector: si non fidèle
Evaluator > Answer: si fidèle
Corrector > Answer
